  "notes": "r3 facing fix of njh_warung_makan. Bangku rot 90 (front +c) faces meja 1 across a 1-tile gap; kursi rot 270 (front -c) faces meja 2 across a gap. Both use real side-view sprites (I1 seats have no true rot-180 back view, so seats were not placed south of the table facing in). Kasir rot 0 customer front faces the door aisle. Kompor/bak rot 0 into the room. Kopi/dispenser pindah ke dinding belakang (menggantikan rak stok) supaya pasangan makan muat.",
